<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>购物 on 编程那些事儿</title><link>https://before80.github.io/prgms/tags/%E8%B4%AD%E7%89%A9/</link><description>Recent content in 购物 on 编程那些事儿</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-cn</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 10:31:03 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://before80.github.io/prgms/tags/%E8%B4%AD%E7%89%A9/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>购物</title><link>https://before80.github.io/prgms/Language/English/Learn/dialogue/life/shopping/</link><pubDate>Mon, 21 Sep 2026 23:40:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://before80.github.io/prgms/Language/English/Learn/dialogue/life/shopping/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;这一篇按&lt;strong&gt;从进店到出店&lt;/strong&gt;的顺序拆成五个细化场景：服装店试穿结账、没带收据怎么退货、问折扣与会员卡、超市里找不到东西、网购到店退换和自提。买东西这件事语言不难，难的是几句必须换说法的话，以及美国商店那套跟中国完全不同的规矩。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>